  <element>
    <id>UMLNote</id>
    <coordinates>
      <x>1680</x>
      <y>900</y>
      <w>490</w>
      <h>140</h>
    </coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>generate() is the fixed template:
1 ctx = contextBuilder.buildCandidateContext()
2 vars = buildPromptVariables()      (hook)
3 content = llmClient.generateStructured(promptKey(), vars, outputSchema())
